// Up a bare 4.5 m cliff (no wall climbing) by rope gun: at its foot, throw the hook up into the ceiling 7.75 m
// above, just in front of the cliff; W grabs it, W climbs (2 m/s), and pressing toward the cliff at its top rolls off the rope
// onto the ledge. Climbing a rope is never a fall: full health at the top.
